# NOTE: bench/ has its own .gitignore covering the things that actually matter
# there — the uv venv, the generated PDS-H and h2o datasets, the duckdb reference
# answers, and results/. Those are gigabytes and are regenerated by `make bench`,
# so they are deliberately not tracked. Do not duplicate those rules here; keeping
# them next to the thing they describe is what makes them findable.
